WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start with a hello. Make space for a friendly, unhurried welcome.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Listen to the question. Understand what they need before offering a solution.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Make the next step easy. Explain what happens next. Close with a thank you.

